<https://w3id.org/railclass/model/darjeeling#livery> a tb:Livery ;
    rdfs:label "Darjeeling Himalayan Railway blue livery (blue tank, bunker and cab with white lining)"@en,
        "ダージリン・ヒマラヤ鉄道の青の塗装（青いタンク・炭庫・運転室に白線）"@ja ;
    dcterms:source "Colours taken automatically from the face materials of skytrain/out/darjeeling/dhr_darjeeling.obj (area share of the painted surface, kept when >= 1.5%, white/grey/black when >= 20%; the colour samples keep them all; tools/extract_colors.py)"@en ;
